The moon photo (assets/moon.png) is a crop of the "Moon Phase and Libration,
2025" visualization by NASA's Scientific Visualization Studio (visualizer:
Ernie Wright, USRA), in the public domain: https://svs.gsfc.nasa.gov/5415

The computation of the widget is a port of the moon phase widget proposed to
the Gladys Assistant core (pull request #2990). The instants of the lunar
events follow the algorithms of J. Meeus, Astronomical Algorithms (2nd ed.).
